  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.5.2:\n      - Adds constructor and record binding for opt-in convention mapping.\n      - Adds explicit existing-destination update mapping through IConventionMapper and EnableUpdateMapping.\n      - Adds constructor and immutable destination diagnostics, sensitive destination write protection for updates, and safe same-element collection shape mapping.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
